EVERY RUN!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Defense</strong> - PROTECT M.O.M. repair firewalls. repair broken firewalls to keep the horde away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Y2K Aesthetics</strong> - A visual love letter to the early 2000s, featuring glitchy effects and nostalgic tech designs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You and your team are a squad of computer defenders that destroy waves of viruses and use their data to restore your software. The more waves you clear, the tougher they become; manage and sacrifice your collected data to upgrade yourself and your base in order to survive longer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Some could say this is the best game on earth, but only the unc could tell”<br>100 – Max Schmid Games<br><br>“Shoreside Bear verified that this game is the most fun game of all of 2026-2027”<br>100 – Ziggy Sudios<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109540/4e7199e92fe177fc9fc7869f9b9329ae53502936/header.jpg?t=1775074354", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109540/669db7ee673a61085c638f0d41faca4e3678038a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775074354", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109540/669db7ee673a61085c638f0d41faca4e3678038a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775074354", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/@DeadclubStudios", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Mid-Range CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "